# Start one Text to Video task with a given model (AIGC Watermark C2PA rows).
# Starts: the Text to Video page (after 「Try It Now」 or 「Create another one」), model row showing Kling 4.0 (KP-083).
# Ends: the task list with the new task 「Processing…」. Charges the model's default price.
# Args: $1 = model name exactly as listed. Written 2026-11-23 on 16.9.0 (2611193), SM-A5360.
waitfor Generate --timeout 60
lbl "Kling 4.0"
wait 2
scrollto "$1"
lbl "$1"
wait 2
setval etv_input "A red kite flying over a green hill on a sunny day, gentle wind"
hidekb
expect "$1"
texts
lbl Generate
